+## [0.46.1]
+
+- Release preparation preserves package README bytes from the saved source,
+  including dependency examples. Maintain those examples during documentation
+  work; they are no longer parsed or rewritten by the release adapter.
+- Retire the renderer through canonical snapshot selection at the existing
+  Shared revision, retaining the other 112 payloads, tool pins and baseline.
+  The exact release file set, receipt binding, rollback and resume remain intact
+  ([#119 — Retire README version rendering](https://github.com/dragginzgame/ic-memory/issues/119)).
+- This is contributor tooling work. Library APIs, stored formats, package
+  versions and dependency selections are unchanged.
+
 ## [0.46.0] - 2026-10-17
 
